  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Flower Power\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Piece:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">Weapon\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Type:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">Two-handed Axe\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Class:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">Fighter\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\"><b>Damage:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\" valign=\"top\">varies with item level\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Flower Power</b> is a fighter two-handed axe.</p>\n\n<p>This item is soulbound. 1st Edition Item Pack Exclusive</p>\n<a name=\"Attributes:\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Attributes: </span></h2>\n<p>No fixed bonuses are known beyond the rainbow name itself.</p>\n<p>Rolled copies can also pick up an extra ending. Those endings and their bonuses are listed on <a href=\"/wiki/Mythic_Suffixes\" title=\"Mythic Suffixes\">Mythic Suffixes</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>",
